type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This system is available in 85-inch and 100-inch screen sizes, suitable for compact spaces without compromising cinematic experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the TheaterPro Mini System be wall-mounted?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the system is designed for wall-mount installation, which optimizes space in bedrooms, small media rooms, and similar compact settings.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the TheaterPro Mini System compare to traditional projectors for home cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike projectors, the TheaterPro Mini delivers consistent 600 nits brightness and 4K UHD clarity without the need for a darkened room or special screens, making it ideal for smaller spaces with ambient light.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty is provided with the TheaterPro Mini System?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance for the TheaterPro Mini, ensuring peace of mind with your investment. Please contact us for specific warranty duration details.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What calibration options come with the system?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The TheaterPro Mini includes basic ISF calibration, providing fine-tuning of color accuracy and picture quality to enhance your cinematic experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of video processor is integrated into the TheaterPro Mini?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It features a slim 4K HDR video processor that supports high dynamic range content, delivering vibrant and lifelike visuals.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this system suitable for guest suites or studies?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. Its comp