org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the TheaterPro Mini System and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The TheaterPro Mini System features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, which ensures very sharp and detailed 4K UHD images even at close viewing distances, perfect for small rooms like bedrooms or studies.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the available sizes of the TheaterPro Mini System?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This system is available in 85-inch and 100-inch screen sizes, suitable for compact spaces without compromising cinematic experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the TheaterPro Mini System be wall-mounted?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the system is designed for wall-mount installation, which optimizes space in bedrooms, small media rooms, and similar compact settings.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the TheaterPro Mini System compare to traditional projectors for home cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike projectors, the TheaterPro Mini delivers consistent 600 nits brightness and 4K UHD clarity without the need for a darkened room or special screens, making it ideal for smaller spaces with ambient light.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty is provided with the TheaterPro Mini System?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance for the TheaterPro Mini, ensuring peace of mind with your investment. Please contact us for specific warranty duration details.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What calibration options come with the system?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The TheaterPro Mini includes basic ISF calibration, providing fine-tuning of color accuracy and picture quality to enhance your cinematic experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of video processor is integrated into the TheaterPro Mini?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It features a slim 4K HDR video processor that supports high dynamic range content, delivering vibrant and lifelike visuals.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this system suitable for guest suites or studies?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. Its compact size, sharp image quality, and ease of installation make the TheaterPro Mini ideal for guest suites and studies where space and convenience are priorities.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"TheaterPro Mini System\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/theaterpro-mini\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T690,<h1>TheaterPro Mini System</h1><p>Compact and powerful TheaterPro Mini LED system in Dubai. Perfect for small venues. Contact Brightluxx UAE to upgrade your display today!</p><p><strong>Compact cinema system for bedrooms and small media rooms.</strong></p><p>TheaterPro Mini brings cinematic quality to smaller spaces — bedrooms, studies, and compact media rooms. The 85&quot; to 100&quot; display uses 1.8mm pixel pitch for sharp 4K content at close viewing distances. Includes a slim video processor, basic ISF calibration, and wall-mount installation. Perfect entry point into LED home cinema without the space requirements of a dedicated theater room.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the TheaterPro Mini System and why is it important?</h3><p>The TheaterPro Mini System features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, which ensures very sharp and detailed 4K UHD images even at close viewing distances, perfect for small rooms like bedrooms or studies.</p><h3>What are the available sizes of the TheaterPro Mini System?</h3><p>This system is available in 85-inch and 100-inch screen sizes, suitable for compact spaces without compromising cinematic experience.</p><h3>Can the TheaterPro Mini System be wall-mounted?</h3><p>Yes, the system is designed for wall-mount installation, which optimizes space in bedrooms, small media rooms, and similar compact settings.</p><h3>How does the TheaterPro Mini System compare to traditional projectors for home cinema?</h3><p>Unlike projectors, the TheaterPro Mini delivers consistent 600 nits brightness and 4K UHD clarity without the need for a darkened room or special screens, making it ideal for smaller spaces with ambient light.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"TheaterPro Mini System | Compact LED Displays Dubai UAE |