 pixel pitch of the TheaterPro Mini System and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The TheaterPro Mini System features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, which ensures very sharp and detailed 4K UHD images even at close viewing distances, perfect for small rooms like bedrooms or studies.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the available sizes of the TheaterPro Mini System?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This system is available in 85-inch and 100-inch screen sizes, suitable for compact spaces without compromising cinematic experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the TheaterPro Mini System be wall-mounted?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the system is designed for wall-mount installation, which optimizes space in bedrooms, small media rooms, and similar compact settings.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the TheaterPro Mini System compare to traditional projectors for home cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike projectors, the TheaterPro Mini delivers consistent 600 nits brightness and 4K UHD clarity without the need for a darkened room or special screens, making it ideal for smaller spaces with ambient light.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty is provided with the TheaterPro Mini System?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance for the TheaterPro Mini, ensuring peace of mind with your investment. Please contact us for specific warranty duration details.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What calibration options come with the system?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The TheaterPro Mini includes basic ISF calibration, providing fine-tuning of color accuracy and picture quality to enhance your cinematic experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of video processor is integrated into the TheaterPro Mini?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It features a slim 4K HDR video processor that supports high dynamic range content, delivering vibrant and lifelike visuals.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this system suitable for guest suites or studies?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. Its compact size, sharp image quality, and ease of installation make the TheaterPro Mini ideal for guest suites and studies where space and convenience are priorities.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"TheaterPro Mini System\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/theaterpro-mini\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.