 venues. Contact Brightluxx UAE to upgrade your display today!</p><p><strong>Compact cinema system for bedrooms and small media rooms.</strong></p><p>TheaterPro Mini brings cinematic quality to smaller spaces — bedrooms, studies, and compact media rooms. The 85&quot; to 100&quot; display uses 1.8mm pixel pitch for sharp 4K content at close viewing distances. Includes a slim video processor, basic ISF calibration, and wall-mount installation. Perfect entry point into LED home cinema without the space requirements of a dedicated theater room.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the TheaterPro Mini System and why is it important?</h3><p>The TheaterPro Mini System features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, which ensures very sharp and detailed 4K UHD images even at close viewing distances, perfect for small rooms like bedrooms or studies.</p><h3>What are the available sizes of the TheaterPro Mini System?</h3><p>This system is available in 85-inch and 100-inch screen sizes, suitable for compact spaces without compromising cinematic experience.</p><h3>Can the TheaterPro Mini System be wall-mounted?</h3><p>Yes, the system is designed for wall-mount installation, which optimizes space in bedrooms, small media rooms, and similar compact settings.</p><h3>How does the TheaterPro Mini System compare to traditional projectors for home cinema?</h3><p>Unlike projectors, the TheaterPro Mini delivers consistent 600 nits brightness and 4K UHD clarity without the need for a darkened room or special screens, making it ideal for smaller spaces with ambient light.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"TheaterPro Mini System | Compact LED Displays Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Compact and powerfu