l rooms like bedrooms or studies.</p><h3>What are the available sizes of the TheaterPro Mini System?</h3><p>This system is available in 85-inch and 100-inch screen sizes, suitable for compact spaces without compromising cinematic experience.</p><h3>Can the TheaterPro Mini System be wall-mounted?</h3><p>Yes, the system is designed for wall-mount installation, which optimizes space in bedrooms, small media rooms, and similar compact settings.</p><h3>How does the TheaterPro Mini System compare to traditional projectors for home cinema?</h3><p>Unlike projectors, the TheaterPro Mini delivers consistent 600 nits brightness and 4K UHD clarity without the need for a darkened room or special screens, making it ideal for smaller spaces with ambient light.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"TheaterPro Mini System | Compact LED Displays Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Compact and powerful TheaterPro Mini LED system in Dubai. Perfect for small venues. Contact Brightluxx UAE to upgrade your display today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/theaterpro-mini\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href